## Summary

POC of data-aware components. Should not be merged

## Examples

```jsx
import { Table } from '@vtex/shoreline-dac'
// UI implementation, normally a client component
import { SimpleTable } from '@vtex/shoreline-components'

// Get the data
async function getData() {
  const res = await fetch('URL')

  if (!res.ok) {
    throw new Error('Failed to fetch data')
  }

  return res.json()
}

export default async function Home() {
  return (
    <Table
      getData={getData}
      component={SimpleTable}
      columns={[
        {
          accessorKey: 'name',
          header: 'Name',
        },
        // ...
      ]}
    />
  )
}
```

This PR fixes https://github.com/microsoft/OpenApi.ApiManifest/issues/46 by making the following changes:
- Adds an `OpenApi` to `ApiManifest` [mapping doc](https://github.com/microsoft/OpenApi.ApiManifest/blob/95f68f6f671f040191c188e426be3089e33a67fa/docs/OpenApiToApiManifestMapping.md) that's implemented by the extension method.
- Adds `ToApiManifest` extension method for `OpenApiDocument`. The method will be used dependent tools to convert and OpenAPI document to an ApiManifest.
- Adds unit tests to validate the conversion.

#### Proposed Usage
``` c#
// Convert an instance of OpenAPIDocument to an ApiManifest document.
var openApiDocument = new OpenApiStreamReader().Read(stream, out var diagnostic);
var apiManifest = openApiDocument.ToApiManifest("https://example.com/openApi.yaml", "MyApplicationName");
// or
var apiManifest = openApiDocument.ToApiManifest("https://example.com/openApi.yaml", "MyApplicationName", "GraphApi", "PubName", "pubemail@example.com");
```
